Value interface (\S+)
Value phy_state ((\S+|\S+ DOWN))
Value protocol_state (\S+)
Value desc (.*)
Value last_phy_uptime (.+)

Start
 ^${interface}\s+current state : ${phy_state}
 ^Line protocol current state : ${protocol_state}
 ^Description:${desc}
 ^Last physical up time   : ${last_phy_uptime}
 ^$$ -> Record